{
    "title": "Skincare Routine: FeelinMySkin",
    "description": "The skincare routines planner & product analyzer your skin deserves, backed by unique tech and scientific research.\r\n\r\nROUTINES:\r\n- Plan Morning & Evening skincare routines to stay consistent\r\n- Set up specific repetitions for each product and get calculated skincare routines for each day\r\n- Set reminders and utilize checkboxes to keep track of what steps you did each day in your routines\r\n- Follow your skincare routines and see improvement in your skin concerns, be it acne, rosacea, or general skin health\r\n- Plan other routines like Haircare, Fitness, House Chores and Hobbies.\r\n\r\nCOMMUNITY FORUM:\r\nAsk questions about your skin and skincare routines. Find friends and support, discuss trends like slugging, double-cleansing, skin-cycling, glass skin, kbeauty and Japanese skincare as well as experience with acne, rosacea or other skin concerns.\r\n\r\nSKIN DIARY & JOURNAL:\r\nFind relations between your skin and lifestyle by taking & comparing photos in the diary, journal skin changes, sleep, mood, and exercise alongside your skin routines.\r\n\r\nINCI INGREDIENTS CHECKER:\r\n- Use INCI Ingredients Analyzer to determine if products in your routines are a good fit for your concerns (acne, rosacea...)\r\n- Check how specific INCI ingredients influence your skin using the INCI ingredients checker.\r\n- Mark your favorite INCI ingredients or the ones you\u2019re allergic to\r\n\r\nPRODUCT FINDER:\r\nSearch a database of 150,000+ skincare products and see what suits your skin concerns best. Apply filters, read reviews and make smart purchases to save yourself both time and money.\r\n\r\nPRODUCT TRACKER:\r\n- Organize and track products in lists, track a wishlist\r\n- Track how long a product lasts, when it was used, its price, and adverse reactions \r\n- Be reminded of expiration dates\r\n\r\nEXPERT GUIDANCE & INSIGHTS:\r\n- Learn about proper skincare practices & INCI ingredients by reading scientific skincare articles in the Study Hub of the Community Forum\r\n- Get daily insights & tips\r\n\r\nDownload FeelinMySkin app now and take the first step to improve your skin health & follow through with your skincare routines\r\n\r\nWe constantly work on improving the app and adding new, requested features to support you on your skincare journey. Enjoy the experience! ;)",
    "descriptionHTML": "The skincare routines planner &amp; product analyzer your skin deserves, backed by unique tech and scientific research.<br><br>ROUTINES:<br>- Plan Morning &amp; Evening skincare routines to stay consistent<br>- Set up specific repetitions for each product and get calculated skincare routines for each day<br>- Set reminders and utilize checkboxes to keep track of what steps you did each day in your routines<br>- Follow your skincare routines and see improvement in your skin concerns, be it acne, rosacea, or general skin health<br>- Plan other routines like Haircare, Fitness, House Chores and Hobbies.<br><br>COMMUNITY FORUM:<br>Ask questions about your skin and skincare routines. Find friends and support, discuss trends like slugging, double-cleansing, skin-cycling, glass skin, kbeauty and Japanese skincare as well as experience with acne, rosacea or other skin concerns.<br><br>SKIN DIARY &amp; JOURNAL:<br>Find relations between your skin and lifestyle by taking &amp; comparing photos in the diary, journal skin changes, sleep, mood, and exercise alongside your skin routines.<br><br>INCI INGREDIENTS CHECKER:<br>- Use INCI Ingredients Analyzer to determine if products in your routines are a good fit for your concerns (acne, rosacea...)<br>- Check how specific INCI ingredients influence your skin using the INCI ingredients checker.<br>- Mark your favorite INCI ingredients or the ones you\u2019re allergic to<br><br>PRODUCT FINDER:<br>Search a database of 150,000+ skincare products and see what suits your skin concerns best. Apply filters, read reviews and make smart purchases to save yourself both time and money.<br><br>PRODUCT TRACKER:<br>- Organize and track products in lists, track a wishlist<br>- Track how long a product lasts, when it was used, its price, and adverse reactions <br>- Be reminded of expiration dates<br><br>EXPERT GUIDANCE &amp; INSIGHTS:<br>- Learn about proper skincare practices &amp; INCI ingredients by reading scientific skincare articles in the Study Hub of the Community Forum<br>- Get daily insights &amp; tips<br><br>Download FeelinMySkin app now and take the first step to improve your skin health &amp; follow through with your skincare routines<br><br>We constantly work on improving the app and adding new, requested features to support you on your skincare journey. Enjoy the experience! ;)",
